# C-Shell
It supports command parsing, quoting, redirection, pipelines, background jobs, process groups, terminal control, directory navigation, file inspection, process inspection, signals, and syscall tracing.
##  Build and Run
### Requirements
- Linux/POSIX environment
- `make`
### Commands
```bash
 make all -> creates .o files and produces shell.out

 ./shell.out -> runs the c-shell
 

 make clean ->deletes shell.out and all .o files
```
